      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3356,
      "text": "And [remember] Abraham, when he said to his people, “Worship Allah and fear Him; that is better for you, if only you knew.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 29,
        "name": "سُورَةُ العَنكَبُوتِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Ankaboot",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Spider",
        "numberOfAyahs": 69,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 16,
      "juz": 20,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 398,
      "ruku": 343,
      "hizbQuarter": 159,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3357,
      "text": "You worship nothing besides Allah but idols and fabricate lies. Those whom you worship besides Allah have no power to give you provision. So seek provision from Allah, worship Him, and be grateful to Him. To Him you will all be returned.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 29,
        "name": "سُورَةُ العَنكَبُوتِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Ankaboot",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Spider",
        "numberOfAyahs": 69,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 17,
      "juz": 20,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 398,
      "ruku": 343,
      "hizbQuarter": 159,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3358,
      "text": "If you reject [the message], so did many nations reject before you. The duty of the Messenger is only to deliver the message clearly[5].”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 29,
        "name": "سُورَةُ العَنكَبُوتِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Ankaboot",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Spider",
        "numberOfAyahs": 69,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 18,
      "juz": 20,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 398,
      "ruku": 343,
      "hizbQuarter": 159,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3359,
      "text": "Do they not see how Allah originates the creation then resurrects it? That is certainly easy for Allah.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 29,
        "name": "سُورَةُ العَنكَبُوتِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Ankaboot",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Spider",
        "numberOfAyahs": 69,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 19,
      "juz": 20,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 398,
      "ruku": 343,
      "hizbQuarter": 159,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3360,
      "text": "Say, “Travel through the land and see how He originated the creation, and then Allah will repeat it a second time. Indeed, Allah is Most Capable of all things.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 29,
        "name": "سُورَةُ العَنكَبُوتِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Ankaboot",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Spider",
        "numberOfAyahs": 69,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 20,
      "juz": 20,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 398,
      "ruku": 343,
      "hizbQuarter": 159,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3361,
      "text": "He punishes whom He wills and shows mercy to whom He wills, and to Him you will all be returned.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 29,
        "name": "سُورَةُ العَنكَبُوتِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Ankaboot",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Spider",
        "numberOfAyahs": 69,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 21,
      "juz": 20,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 398,
      "ruku": 343,
      "hizbQuarter": 159,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3362,
      "text": "You cannot escape [His punishment] on earth or in heaven, and you have no protector or helper besides Allah.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 29,
        "name": "سُورَةُ العَنكَبُوتِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Ankaboot",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Spider",
        "numberOfAyahs": 69,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 22,
      "juz": 20,
